Type: Package
Package: teachIRT
Title: Functions to Teach and Explore Item Response Theory
Version: 1.1.0
Author: Jan Killisch
Maintainer: Jan Killisch <jan.killisch@rptu.de>
Description: Simple utilities to teach and explore unidimensional IRT models
